\newlabel{fig:RC_lW}{{18}{13}{\textbf {Rigid Cylinder Campaign}. Left: $\lambda /W_{\rm core}$ vs.\ $f$ for all $\beta $ values; green shading = HGBS window $[2.52, 3.08]$. Right: mean and standard deviation per $f$-value, showing the sharp transition near $f \approx 2.4$--$2.6$}{figure.18}{}}
